ORDER CONFIRMED! 🎉
==================

Hello <%= @user&.name || 'Customer' %>!

We've received your order and are processing it. You'll receive another email once your payment is confirmed.

ORDER DETAILS
=============
Order Number: #<%= @order.id %>
Order Date: <%= @order_date %> at <%= @order_time %>
Customer Email: <%= @order.user_email %>
Status: <%= @order.status.titleize %>
Payment Status: <%= @order.payment_status&.titleize || 'Pending' %>

ORDER ITEMS
===========
<% @order_items.each do |item| %>
• <%= item.product.name %>
  Quantity: <%= item.quantity %>
  <% if item.validity_type.present? %>Validity: <%= item.validity_type.titleize %> - <%= item.validity_duration %> days<% end %>
  Price: ₹<%= item.subtotal %>

<% end %>

<% if @applied_offers.any? %>
APPLIED OFFERS
==============
<% @applied_offers.each do |offer| %>
• <%= offer.name %>: -₹<%= offer.order_offers.find_by(order: @order).discount_amount %>
<% end %>

<% end %>
ORDER SUMMARY
=============
Subtotal: ₹<%= @order.subtotal %>
<% if @order.total_discount > 0 %>Discount: -₹<%= @order.total_discount %><% end %>
Total Amount: ₹<%= @order.total_amount %>

WHAT'S NEXT?
============
• Complete your payment to activate your order
• You'll receive a payment confirmation email once payment is successful
• Access your products immediately after payment confirmation
• Contact support if you need any assistance

View your order: <%= order_url(@order) %>

NEED HELP?
==========
If you have any questions about your order, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.

Email: support@pisoftsolutions.in

